#. translators: Multi-paragraph text used to display in the Apple App Store.
msgctxt "app_store_desc"
msgid ""
"Pocket Casts is the world's most powerful podcast platform, now built for the "
"biggest screen in the house. An app by listeners, for listeners. Find your nex"
"t obsession with hand-curated recommendations, and settle in without the hassl"
"e of subscribing.\n"
"\n"
"YOUR PLAYLISTS, ON THE BIG SCREEN\n"
"\n"
"Build them on your phone. They'll be waiting for you here.\n"
"\n"
"Playlists: Curate your perfect mix on any other Pocket Casts app, then sit bac"
"k and press play. Combine episodes from different podcasts, or build a collect"
"ion around a guest or a theme.\n"
"Smart Playlists: Rules you set on release date, duration and more, kept update"
"d automatically and synced straight to your couch.\n"
"\n"
"WE SWEAT THE DETAILS\n"
"\n"
"Design: Built for the remote. Browse, manage and discover new podcasts without"
" ever reaching for your phone.\n"
"Everywhere: Phone, watch, car, speakers, and now your TV. Start an episode on "
"one, finish it on another.\n"
"Sync: Subscriptions, Up Next, listening history, playback and filters, all sec"
"ured in the cloud. Pick up where you left off, wherever you left off.\n"
"Refresh: Let our servers check for new episodes, so you can get on with your e"
"vening.\n"
"\n"
"POWERFUL PLAYBACK\n"
"\n"
"Up next: Automatically build a playback queue from your favorite shows. Sign i"
"n and it syncs to every device, TV included.\n"
"Trim silence: Cut silences from episodes so you finish them faster, saving hou"
"rs.\n"
"Variable speed: Change the play speed anywhere from 0.5 to 3x.\n"
"Volume boost: Turn up the voices, turn down the noise.\n"
"Chapters: Jump between chapters easily, and enjoy embedded artwork the author "
"added (MP3 and M4A chapter formats supported).\n"
"Audio & video: Video podcasts play as video, automatically.\n"
"\n"
"ALL YOUR FAVORITES\n"
"\n"
"Discover: Recommendations that actually know you, trending shows before your g"
"roup chat finds them, and lists curated by actual humans, not an algorithm gue"
"ssing in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"There are many more powerful, straightforward features that make Pocket Casts "
"the best way to listen from the couch.\n"
"\n"
"Visit pocketcasts.com for more info about the web and other platforms supporte"
"d by Pocket Casts.\n"
"\n"
"Terms of Use: https://support.pocketcasts.com/article/terms-of-use\n"
"Privacy Policy: https://support.pocketcasts.com/article/privacy-policy"
msgstr ""

